  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enabling Low-emission Urban Transport (LEUT) in Greater Lom&#xe9;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project objective is to implement an initial stage of a low-emission urban transport system by increasing public transport usage by low-carbon public buses and non-motorized transport (NMT) modes. The project will enhance relevant national stakeholders&apos; capacities in developing, implementing, and monitoring low-emission urban transport systems while paving the way to replicate it.</narrative>
